  "2026-10-27T10:41:39.819Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof: independently restoring case-sensitive filter matching, mapping destinations, mapped/unmapped export deduplication, issue-form contract labels, form/export composition, PATCH labels, POST labels, rename collisions, or the shared name key makes its focused regression fail (all nine exit 1). Removing the two-worker cap independently fails its guard test (exit 1). Every changed file was restored byte-for-byte after each proof. Full focused feature run passed 11/11, including 500 mixed-case SDK state sequences plus 500 generated export/form permutations; planner and shared-name helper both have exact 100/100/100/100 targeted coverage. Pinned pm linked-test run passed the three provider-name class tests. Catalog revision bindings, opaque IDs and local mapping keys remain exact by explicit adversarial assertions."
