  "2026-10-27T18:32:27.128Z",codex-agent,"CI follow-up discovered during round 4: the prior receipt head completed all tests with zero failures, but all four release gates failed the unchanged 100% branch threshold at 99.97%. The uncovered path is duplicate tag-option-to-CLI formatting in the plain full-update branch; the empty additive case is exercised in the separate link-only branch. I am factoring both CLI paths through one import-owned formatter so replace/add/empty decisions have one boundary and the existing real-SDK owner regressions cover every branch. No threshold, source inventory or test is removed. Prior CI receipt: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/40541580890; current compatibility source CI is https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/40560437533."
  "2026-10-27T18:35:01.534Z",codex-agent,"The shared plain-CLI tag formatter is now covered at 100/100/100/100 by four focused real-SDK regressions (plain citation adoption/reimport, plain and atomic retained owner imports with a replay, and the shared import conversion test). The formatter reuses importTagOptions; replacement/additive/empty decisions no longer diverge between CLI branches. Both existing update paths call it. New-item creation remains a complete replacement from the same options producer; Projects and atomic paths already consume SDK options without native-to-CSV round trips. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, docstrings and duplication pass again: 237 documented declarations, 12620 authored lines, zero duplicated lines. A fresh minimum-consumer check and captured-pack acceptance are running because the shipped source changed."
  "2026-10-27T18:37:49.024Z",codex-agent,"Formatter behavioral mutation proof: changing only the shared formatter from additive --add-tags to replacement --tags in a disposable copy makes the plain retained-owner SDK regression fail with persisted-corpus provenance refusal. This is an observed state failure: replacement removes the retained provenance/native atoms. Restoring the formatter makes the identical regression pass (1/1). The four focused regressions also pass with complete helper coverage. The final production source passes npm run test:minimum-sdk through linked pm test --run --progress (1/1), including source and published declaration compilation at exact SDK 2026.10.17."
  "2026-10-27T18:47:25.966Z",codex-agent,"Final formatter source receipts: linked pm test --run --match node_modules/.bin/c8 --progress passes four tests and 100/100/100/100 helper coverage. The final source passes linked npm run test:minimum-sdk (1/1). Refreshed node test/label-migration-real-data.ts passes all five physical CLI consumers and standalone Node/Bun SDK consumers using one 290159-byte captured artifact, SHA256 e79bc740ffa2daa5e58c3df509161843b21b96d55e65737bcd5731aafffe08c5. Public counts stay 155 items, 12 labels, one stored tag plus two declared policies, three rows and 1146 JSON bytes, with unchanged source bytes. The last fetch reports 14 ahead and zero behind main. A final native-Bun exact-minimum rerun is in progress before handoff; all release thresholds and existing tests remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-27T18:53:24.222Z",codex-agent,"Round-4 source validation is complete: exact-minimum packed consumers pass on final production source under Node (1/1) and native Bun 1.3.14 (1/1); all 80 named SDK imports and shipped declarations work at 2026.10.17. Published tarballs establish decoder floor 2026.10.9 and transaction-match floor 2026.10.17; minimum-only reversions fail at 2026.10.5 and 2026.10.15, then restored 2026.10.17 passes. The common CLI formatter passes four linked SDK regressions with 100/100/100/100 helper coverage; its destructive-replacement mutation fails and restoration passes. All five final packed CLI modes and two installed SDK runtimes pass against unchanged read-only public data. Source commits are fcc0cec5df4664dbb7bed7bc7ed71039345352ff and 5fc3175987601dbc1340ed384065c0126becf2de. Source CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/40563468912 currently has 0/4 release jobs completed (all queued); CodeQL https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/40563468427 is pending. The superseded compatibility-only CI run was canceled after finding the duplicate-formatter coverage gap; cancellation is not evidence. Privacy passes over 7553 Git objects with no identity, secret or host-path findings. Final receipt changes only this item and append-only history; fresh final-head CI URLs and gate counts will be maintained in PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/188 after the bounded 30-minute wait. No full release gate pass is claimed yet. Releasing my own claim; the item stays in progress and unclosed for orchestrator verification."
